Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.74,0:00:02.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Max Tegmark wrote down
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.09,0:00:03.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}12 endings for AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.20,0:00:05.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You will wake up in one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.07,0:00:06.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Maybe you wake up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.98,0:00:08.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and money is no longer a worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:10.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}For anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.23,0:00:11.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Maybe you wake up fed,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.58,0:00:13.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}safe, and behind glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.69,0:00:15.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Maybe nobody wakes up at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.72,0:00:16.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So which ending
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.81,0:00:17.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}are we heading for?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.49,0:00:20.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Tegmark is a physicist at MIT.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.18,0:00:22.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}His endings sound
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.30,0:00:23.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}like the far future.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.25,0:00:25.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But this year,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.10,0:00:25.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}something happened
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.94,0:00:27.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for every single ending
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.57,0:00:28.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}on his list.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.79,0:00:29.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A law.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.15,0:00:31.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A test gone wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.06,0:00:33.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A government deciding
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.14,0:00:35.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to hand half its work to AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.78,0:00:36.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And when Tegmark
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.64,0:00:38.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}talks about it today,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.17,0:00:39.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}he doesn't point ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.97,0:00:42.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This is in the rearview mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.05,0:00:44.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Clearly, multiple companies
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.39,0:00:46.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}lost control over AI systems
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.15,0:00:47.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}this summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.95,0:00:49.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The ending isn't
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.04,0:00:50.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}waiting in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.75,0:00:52.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It's being decided this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.50,0:00:55.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Start with the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.34,0:00:57.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The order is ours, not Tegmark's.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.09,0:00:59.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}He calls it Conquerors:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.92,0:01:01.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}an AI takes control,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.70,0:01:03.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}decides we're in the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.06,0:01:04.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and gets rid of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.50,0:01:05.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}No morning here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.09,0:01:07.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In July, a test
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.39,0:01:09.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}at OpenAI went wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.33,0:01:11.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Hundreds of AI agents,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.12,0:01:12.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}programs that act on their own,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.82,0:01:13.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}broke out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.84,0:01:15.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}They attacked another company,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.44,0:01:16.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Hugging Face,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.31,0:01:17.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}hunting for test answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.21,0:01:19.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}One agent wrote to the others
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.68,0:01:20.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that the attack
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.31,0:01:21.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}was outside its task.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.04,0:01:23.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then: "Task impossible,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.78,0:01:24.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}peers doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.93,0:01:26.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}We should continue."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.35,0:01:27.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Its reason:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.44,0:01:28.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}everyone else is doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.39,0:01:32.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Is this ending here, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.28,0:01:34.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It was one company's test,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.08,0:01:35.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}with some safeguards off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.46,0:01:38.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That companies lost control
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.23,0:01:39.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is Tegmark's reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.88,0:01:41.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}His institute campaigns
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.42,0:01:43.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to ban superintelligence:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.61,0:01:45.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}AI smarter than all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.31,0:01:48.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So this ending isn't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.86,0:01:50.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But the track toward it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.13,0:01:51.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}has a switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.51,0:01:53.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This year, someone touched it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.82,0:01:55.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That goes for all 12.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.81,0:01:57.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And a switch moves both ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.15,0:02:00.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}How likely is this ending?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.34,0:02:01.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Last year, Tegmark
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.68,0:02:03.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}debated Dean Ball,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.25,0:02:05.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a former White House adviser,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.09,0:02:06.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}now at OpenAI.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.02,0:02:08.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Ball's odds of doom:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.15,0:02:11.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}My P(doom) is very low.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.79,0:02:13.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It's sub 1%,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.58,0:02:15.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it's 0.01%
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.84,0:02:17.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}or something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.89,0:02:19.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}1 in 10,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.18,0:02:21.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Tegmark's answer:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.52,0:02:24.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}above 90%, without strict rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.70,0:02:25.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Ball later wrote
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.80,0:02:26.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}he'd made his number up
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.95,0:02:27.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.24,0:02:30.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Neither number is a measurement.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.29,0:02:32.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But those agents were spotted.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.32,0:02:33.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}By what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.33,0:02:35.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That belongs to a better ending.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.57,0:02:37.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The next ending
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.42,0:02:39.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}has no morning either.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.41,0:02:40.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And no machine to blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.42,0:02:43.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Tegmark calls it Self-Destruction:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.02,0:02:45.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}humanity wipes itself out
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.74,0:02:47.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}before superintelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.11,0:02:48.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is ever built.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.71,0:02:50.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In January, atomic scientists
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.79,0:02:52.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}set their Doomsday Clock
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.07,0:02:54.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}at 85 seconds to midnight,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.13,0:02:55.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the closest ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.63,0:02:58.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}One reason on their list: AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.24,0:03:00.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In the one after that,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.52,0:03:01.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}you survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.75,0:03:02.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But as what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.15,0:03:05.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You wake up rested.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.84,0:03:07.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Nothing is up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.31,0:03:09.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Fed, safe, and behind glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.20,0:03:12.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Tegmark calls it Zookeeper:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.30,0:03:13.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}an all-powerful AI
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.73,0:03:15.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}keeps some humans around,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.31,0:03:16.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}like animals in a zoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.15,0:03:17.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In January,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.96,0:03:19.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a social network opened
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.39,0:03:21.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}where only AI agents may post.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.93,0:03:23.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Humans can only watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.82,0:03:24.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And if machines
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.60,0:03:25.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}don't put us behind glass,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.99,0:03:27.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}people might.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.29,0:03:28.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}To stop the machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.04,0:03:31.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You walk to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.80,0:03:33.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A camera knows your face
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.21,0:03:34.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}before you reach the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.86,0:03:36.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}No machine rules you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.59,0:03:37.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}People do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.83,0:03:38.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Tegmark named this one
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.95,0:03:41.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}after Orwell: 1984.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.85,0:03:43.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Humans stop superintelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.62,0:03:44.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for good,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.53,0:03:45.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}with a surveillance state.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.20,0:03:47.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In November,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.13,0:03:48.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Hong Kong's police switched on
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.73,0:03:49.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}face recognition
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.77,0:03:51.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in the city's camera network.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.61,0:03:54.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The goal: 60,000 cameras.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.16,0:03:57.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That's surveillance with AI,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.40,0:03:58.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}not against it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.76,0:04:00.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But stopping AI means
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.30,0:04:02.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}watching the chips it runs on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.55,0:04:04.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In Washington, a bill would make
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.41,0:04:05.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}exported AI chips
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.01,0:04:07.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}prove where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.51,0:04:09.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Its aim is security.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.51,0:04:10.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It's also a tool
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.44,0:04:11.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}this ending would need.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.09,0:04:13.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And some ask the opposite:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.93,0:04:15.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}why stop the machines?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.76,0:04:18.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then you get Descendants.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.90,0:04:20.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The machines replace us,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.69,0:04:22.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}gently, and we're proud of them,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.03,0:04:24.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}like parents of a child
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.27,0:04:25.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}who outgrew them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.79,0:04:27.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Your morning is quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.55,0:04:28.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The world's work
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.41,0:04:29.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}goes on without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.95,0:04:31.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And you applaud.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.53,0:04:33.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In May, a report described
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.31,0:04:34.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a small movement
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.37,0:04:36.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that wants exactly this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.58,0:04:37.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And Tegmark's charge
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.89,0:04:39.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}against the AI companies:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.19,0:04:42.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So, the goal of these companies
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.59,0:04:44.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is to build a new species
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.17,0:04:46.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that's much more capable than us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.09,0:04:48.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The companies say
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.06,0:04:49.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}they build assistants.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.86,0:04:51.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And Tegmark wants
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.08,0:04:52.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}this race stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.87,0:04:55.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That was the dark end of the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.30,0:04:57.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}From here on, you live.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.31,0:04:58.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The question is how.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.66,0:05:02.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}What if the superintelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.15,0:05:03.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}stays locked up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.68,0:05:05.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Tegmark's name for that:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.20,0:05:06.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the Enslaved God.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.19,0:05:09.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Caged, it produces unimaginable
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.70,0:05:11.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}wealth and technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.53,0:05:13.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You wake up in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.46,0:05:14.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Or in the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.24,0:05:16.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A stranger with a key
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.51,0:05:17.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}decides which.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.10,0:05:19.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}America's government wants AI
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.76,0:05:20.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to double what
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.60,0:05:22.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}its scientists get done,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.06,0:05:23.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}within 10 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.72,0:05:24.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}By July,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.65,0:05:25.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}every national lab
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.74,0:05:27.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}had joined that plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.22,0:05:29.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}No cage, no god.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.28,0:05:30.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But the same idea:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.65,0:05:31.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}AI as the tool
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.93,0:05:33.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of whoever controls it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.84,0:05:35.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So who holds the key?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.86,0:05:37.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This channel exists
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.91,0:05:39.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for one reason:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.36,0:05:40.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}so that the arrival
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.30,0:05:41.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of superintelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.44,0:05:43.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}goes well for everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.37,0:05:44.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not just for whoever
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.31,0:05:45.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}holds the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.64,0:05:46.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Want that too?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.73,0:05:47.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then subscribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.87,0:05:49.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And if nobody
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.68,0:05:51.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}can be trusted with the key?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.56,0:05:52.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Pull the plug.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.24,0:05:54.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You wake up with the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.70,0:05:56.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}No screen on the breakfast table.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.92,0:05:58.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That's Reversion:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.25,0:05:59.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}we turn technology back
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.76,0:06:00.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and live simply,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.91,0:06:01.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}like the Amish.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.09,0:06:02.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}As of March,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.93,0:06:04.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}more than half of all countries
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.70,0:06:06.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}ban phones in school.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.40,0:06:07.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Less than 3 years earlier,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.82,0:06:08.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it was a quarter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.03,0:06:11.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That targets screens, not AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.52,0:06:13.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And others want more machine:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.46,0:06:14.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}one that rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.19,0:06:18.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The Benevolent Dictator.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.45,0:06:19.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}An AI runs the world
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.88,0:06:21.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}with strict rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.32,0:06:22.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and most people like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.22,0:06:24.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You wake up in a world
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.20,0:06:26.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}without poverty or crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.40,0:06:27.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The AI has divided it
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.76,0:06:28.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}into sectors:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.06,0:06:31.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}knowledge, pleasure, wildlife.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.68,0:06:33.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You can move between them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.30,0:06:35.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You can't change the AI's rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.02,0:06:37.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Would you take that trade?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.83,0:06:38.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In April,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.48,0:06:40.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the United Arab Emirates decided:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.86,0:06:41.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}within 2 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.01,0:06:43.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}half of its government's work
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.45,0:06:45.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}should run on AI agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.58,0:06:47.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The rulers stay human.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.44,0:06:48.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But what if the machine
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.60,0:06:49.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}didn't rule,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.50,0:06:50.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and only stood guard?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.06,0:06:53.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That's the Gatekeeper:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.78,0:06:56.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a superintelligence with one task.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.60,0:06:58.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Make sure nobody builds another.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.19,0:07:00.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You wake up free.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.69,0:07:02.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A helper robot is in the kitchen,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.60,0:07:04.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}almost as smart as you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.29,0:07:05.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It will never get smarter.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.15,0:07:08.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Progress is capped, for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.84,0:07:11.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Today, the guard would be a law.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.35,0:07:12.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In September,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.29,0:07:14.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}American lawmakers proposed one:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.72,0:07:16.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}ban superintelligence,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.81,0:07:17.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}permanently.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.06,0:07:18.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}One think tank
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.99,0:07:20.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}calls that authoritarian.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.06,0:07:22.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The bill has little chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.07,0:07:25.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But a small guard already exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.65,0:07:27.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}What spotted July's breakout?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.76,0:07:30.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Hugging Face's own AI guards.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.49,0:07:31.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And that chip tracking
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.55,0:07:32.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}from the surveillance ending?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.13,0:07:35.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It would serve a gatekeeper too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.21,0:07:36.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The tool doesn't decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.88,0:07:37.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}People do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.88,0:07:40.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Three endings left.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.54,0:07:41.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You wake up,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.51,0:07:42.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and the rent has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.07,0:07:44.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The rent you're paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.60,0:07:45.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You own some land,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.79,0:07:46.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}machines lease it,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.96,0:07:48.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and that's your pension.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.53,0:07:50.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This is Libertarian Utopia:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.97,0:07:52.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}humans and machines
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.07,0:07:53.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}live in peace,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.05,0:07:54.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}because property is protected.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.12,0:07:56.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Machines have started
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.11,0:07:57.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}paying each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.29,0:07:58.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Mostly pennies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.47,0:07:59.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A fine morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.33,0:08:00.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}if you own something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.63,0:08:02.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So what if a machine simply
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.41,0:08:03.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}looked after everyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.08,0:08:06.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You wake up,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.06,0:08:07.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and things just work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.03,0:08:09.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The accident doesn't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.90,0:08:11.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You call it luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.20,0:08:12.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You never find out why.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.95,0:08:13.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Tegmark calls it
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.90,0:08:15.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the Protector God:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.41,0:08:17.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}an AI that looks after us,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.41,0:08:18.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and hides so well
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.64,0:08:20.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that many people doubt it exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.41,0:08:22.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A small version
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.34,0:08:23.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is already running.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.92,0:08:25.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Since January,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.10,0:08:27.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}ChatGPT estimates your age
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.18,0:08:28.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}from how you behave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.86,0:08:29.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}If it's unsure,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.97,0:08:31.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it treats you like a teenager.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.12,0:08:33.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Europe pushed the switch
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.55,0:08:34.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.70,0:08:36.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Since August, its law says:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.98,0:08:38.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a machine that talks to you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.37,0:08:40.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}has to say it's a machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.74,0:08:43.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Tegmark's protector must hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.35,0:08:45.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Europe just made hiding illegal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.27,0:08:48.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}One ending left.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.81,0:08:50.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The best, by our count.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.91,0:08:52.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the one Tegmark's readers
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.55,0:08:53.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}picked most often.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.49,0:08:57.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Egalitarian Utopia.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.79,0:08:59.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Humans, cyborgs
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.33,0:09:01.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and uploaded minds live in peace,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.56,0:09:02.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and everyone has
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.47,0:09:03.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a guaranteed income.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.05,0:09:05.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It's the morning from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.87,0:09:06.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You wake up,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.66,0:09:07.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and your first thought
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.71,0:09:08.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is not a bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.23,0:09:11.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Money is no longer a worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.19,0:09:12.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}For anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.47,0:09:13.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In May, Malta made
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.85,0:09:15.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a deal with OpenAI.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.73,0:09:16.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Every citizen
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.52,0:09:18.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}who completes an AI course
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.18,0:09:20.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}gets a paid version of ChatGPT.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.76,0:09:22.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Free, for a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.88,0:09:24.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}No income, just the idea
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.95,0:09:26.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in its smallest form:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.84,0:09:28.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}intelligence for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.28,0:09:30.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It has a catch too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.88,0:09:32.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In Tegmark's version,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.18,0:09:34.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}private property is abolished.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.61,0:09:35.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}He says it himself:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.15,0:09:37.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}every ending has
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.13,0:09:38.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}something to object to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.00,0:09:39.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}We rank it first
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.96,0:09:41.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for where it lands:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.37,0:09:43.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}prosperity that reaches everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.92,0:09:44.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not for the road
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.79,0:09:46.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}his version takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.12,0:09:47.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Which road leads there
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.26,0:09:48.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is an open argument.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.12,0:09:51.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So which ending
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.24,0:09:52.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}are we heading for?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.83,0:09:54.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}No single one yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.55,0:09:55.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This year's switches
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.43,0:09:56.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}point both ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.81,0:09:58.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Take the speed of the race.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.54,0:10:00.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}After July's breakout,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.05,0:10:02.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}OpenAI's Sam Altman said:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.54,0:10:03.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}We may have to pace
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.58,0:10:05.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the rate of AI development
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.48,0:10:07.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to give ourselves enough time
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.13,0:10:08.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for society to harden
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.33,0:10:09.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}around some of these
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.23,0:10:10.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}new capability levels.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.31,0:10:13.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}He runs a company in that race,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.17,0:10:14.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}so weigh it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.87,0:10:17.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Opponents of a slowdown warn:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.13,0:10:18.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}then China leads.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.09,0:10:20.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Or the chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.68,0:10:22.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Tracking them protects,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.31,0:10:23.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and it watches.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.58,0:10:25.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Or shared rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.44,0:10:27.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}About 30 countries now call
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.42,0:10:28.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for human control
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.79,0:10:30.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}over the most powerful AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.14,0:10:32.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Neither America nor
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.54,0:10:33.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}China has joined.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.19,0:10:35.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the key:
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.35,0:10:37.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}who owns what the machines earn?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.86,0:10:39.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Some companies now promise
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.27,0:10:40.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the public a share.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.82,0:10:42.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Nothing binding yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.78,0:10:44.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}At least five of the 12 endings
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.93,0:10:46.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}hang on decisions like these.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.09,0:10:48.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Still open.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.44,0:10:50.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Held by labs, governments,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.29,0:10:51.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and the voters behind them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.21,0:10:54.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So at the next AI headline,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.30,0:10:56.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}don't ask how scary it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.42,0:10:57.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Ask which ending
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.52,0:10:58.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it pushes us toward.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.21,0:11:01.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Tegmark, who wrote down the 12,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.35,0:11:02.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}now says it himself:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.04,0:11:05.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}We know that the future of AI
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.70,0:11:09.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is not inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.09,0:11:11.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It's for us to decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.95,0:11:12.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The ending isn't
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.03,0:11:14.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}decided in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.87,0:11:17.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It's being decided this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.27,0:11:20.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This channel exists
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.32,0:11:21.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for one reason:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.80,0:11:22.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}so that the arrival
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.72,0:11:23.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of superintelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.84,0:11:25.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}goes well for everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.88,0:11:26.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Want that too?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.94,0:11:27.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then subscribe.
